{"id":47599,"date":"2026-01-02T09:31:05","date_gmt":"2026-01-02T08:31:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47599"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:01:56","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:01:56","slug":"trail-terras-de-oia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-terras-de-oia\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Terras de Oi\u00e3 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Decorre no pr\u00f3ximo dia&nbsp;<strong>26 de julho de 2026<\/strong>&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>7.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail \u2013 Terras de Oi\u00e3<\/strong>. A prova realiza-se em trilhos e estradas florestais na&nbsp;<strong>Freguesia de Oi\u00e3<\/strong>, atravessando uma consider\u00e1vel \u00e1rea florestal com vista privilegiada sobre v\u00e1rios afluentes do&nbsp;<strong>Rio Levira<\/strong>&nbsp;e do&nbsp;<strong>Rio C\u00e9rtima<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O percurso inclui passagem pelo&nbsp;<strong>Parque da Fonte Doce<\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Parque da Seara<\/strong>&nbsp;e por v\u00e1rios olivais, apresentando&nbsp;<strong>trilhos completamente novos e renovados<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A partida e a chegada ter\u00e3o lugar no&nbsp;<strong>novo Parque Verde da Vila de Oi\u00e3<\/strong>, junto \u00e0&nbsp;<strong>Junta de Freguesia de Oi\u00e3<\/strong>, culminando com um&nbsp;<strong>almo\u00e7o de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":47600,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47599","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-oia-oliveira-do-bairr